inicia por la selva de Oza y se encamina a la subida del refugio D’Acher. La ruta solo es hasta una zona en la que se observa una panorámica del Castillo de Acher, quedarían aún unos 300 metros aproximadamente de desnivel hasta el refugio.]]></desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="42.831847" lon="-0.712035"><ele>1125.835</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:17Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831818" lon="-0.711971"><ele>1125.186</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:22Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831778" lon="-0.711939"><ele>1124.414</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:26Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.83174" lon="-0.711903"><ele>1124.309</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:30Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831725" lon="-0.711839"><ele>1124.265</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:34Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831699" lon="-0.711778"><ele>1124.122</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:39Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831728" lon="-0.711716"><ele>1123.958</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:43Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831751" lon="-0.711654"><ele>1123.644</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:48Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831759" lon="-0.71159"><ele>1123.513</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:52Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831772" lon="-0.711523"><ele>1123.537</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:14:56Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831792" lon="-0.71145"><ele>1123.561</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:15:01Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.8318" lon="-0.71138"><ele>1123.744</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:15:06Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831816" lon="-0.711317"><ele>1123.968</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:15:10Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831822" lon="-0.711255"><ele>1124.013</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:15:14Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831842" lon="-0.711194"><ele>1124.243</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:15:18Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831852" lon="-0.711119"><ele>1124.407</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:15:23Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831866" lon="-0.711059"><ele>1124.609</ele><time>2026-10-25T09:15:27Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="42.831877" lon="-0.710994"><ele>1124.853</ele><time>20